WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Good morning, John! It is Halloween and the last thing

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.180
I need is an excuse to put stuff on my head.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:11.600
♫

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:13.820
These are funny.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.560
I don't think they're made for men!

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.660
These aren't really men horns.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.540
They're kind of extra fuzzy.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:20.860
Maybe if I put them like this.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.700
HrrrrRRRRRrrrrr!

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.500
Oh! Well, just like that, rest them on my glasses.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.900
Perfect! PERFECT!

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.940
Halloween is a very Nerdfighterly day, as far as I'm concerned.

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:32.220
I mean, it's not like we need an excuse to, you know, be weird.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.920
Frankly, I think that we should do it every day.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:38.680
But it occurred to me recently that I wasn't really gonna be able to participate in Halloween because I'm packing

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.900
so that we can begin the Nerdfighter tour very, very soon.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.880
So yeah, I'm not going to any Halloween parties.

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:46.960
We are giving out candy, but that's pretty much the extent of our Halloweeny activities.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:50.300
But it did occur to me that it's quite obvious what I should be for Halloween.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.420
And that is, of course...

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:53.780
Edward Spoonhands.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.240
And if you don't know what I'm talking about, then that's just too bad.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:59.420
You will soon. Like, now.

